WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.200
Jellyfin stays the stable center: the
official Jellyfin 12 experience remains
intact. Semantic discovery adds capability
without replacing the UI.

2
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:20.550
The plugin joins Jellyfin as an internal
search provider and similar-items
providers. It returns item IDs and
scores—not passages—through native
discovery.

3
00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:30.417
Aspire 17 orchestrates the official
Jellyfin container, the plugin, Ollama,
and a .NET 11 ASP.NET Core document
extraction service.

4
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:41.983
Ollama runs embeddinggemma plus
qwen3-vl:8b, with an optional 4b profile,
to read rendered PDF pages. The full
capability runs locally with Ollama.

